msgid "gluon-config-mode:welcome"
msgstr ""
"<p>Welcome to the setup wizard of your new Freifunk node.</p><p>Please start by "
"choosing a name that follows the pattern <pre style=\"display:inline;\">&lt;ZIP&gt;-"
"&lt;fantasyname&gt;</pre> (e.g. <pre style=\"display:inline;\">64289-unicorn</pre>), "
"where <i>64289</i> refers to the postal code at the location the node is going to be "
"set up at and <i>unicorn</i> to a name that can be freely chosen by yourself.</p>"

msgid "gluon-config-mode:domain"
msgstr "Domain"

msgid "gluon-config-mode:domain-select"
msgstr ""
"Here you have the possibility of selecting the domain in which your node is placed. "
"Please keep in mind that your router only connects with the mesh of the selected "
"domain. You can determine your domain on the Freifunk Darmstadt <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://darmstadt.freifunk.net/einzugsgebiet/\">website</a>."

msgid "gluon-config-mode:pubkey"
msgstr ""
"<p>This is the public key of your Freifunk node. The router will only connect to the "
"mesh-vpn after it has been activated. Therefore please send its public key and name "
"via email to <a href=\"mailto:info@freie-netze-suedhessen.de?subject=Registration:"
"%20<%=urlencode(hostname)%>&amp;body=%23%20<%=urlencode(hostname)"
"%>%0A%23%20<%=platform.get_image_name()"
"%>%0A%23%20<%=sysconfig.primary_mac%>%0Akey%20%22<%=pubkey%>%22%3B\">info@freie-netze-"
"suedhessen.de</a>.</p><div class=\"the-key\"> # <%= pcdata(hostname) %><br /> # <%= "
"platform.get_image_name() %><br /> # <%= sysconfig.primary_mac %><br />key \"<%= "
"pubkey %>\";</div>"

msgid "gluon-config-mode:novpn"
msgstr ""
"<p><div class=\"the-key\">You have chosen <strong>not to use</strong> your internet "
"connection to setup a VPN-connection to the local Freifunk backbone. Your node will "
"only be able to participate in the network when other Freifunk nodes are in range to "
"mesh with it.</div></p>"

msgid "gluon-config-mode:reboot"
msgstr ""
"<p>Your node is currently rebooting and will then attempt to create mesh connections "
"with neighbouring Freifunk nodes. Place your router next to a window or, in case it "
"is weatherproof, outside the window, to achieve the best reception.</p><p>If you have "
"further questions or want to get in touch with your mesh neighbours or the community "
"in general you can join our Matrix room: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://"
"matrix.to/#/%23fnsh:matrix.tu-darmstadt.de\">#fnsh:matrix.tu-darmstadt.de</a></li></"
"ul><p>We'll gladly answer all of your questions and are eagerly awaiting your "
"projects and ideas, like long distance radio links to connect different locations.</"
"p><p>Join us, be a part of our community!</p>"

msgid "gluon-config-mode:altitude-label"
msgstr "Altitude"

msgid "gluon-config-mode:altitude-help"
msgstr ""
"Specifying the altitude is optional and should only be done if a proper value is "
"known."
